<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves dip in February.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves dip in February.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 113.537 trillion lire at end-February, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    Feb 97	 Jan 97	 Feb 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    113.537	113.617	89.120</p>
<p>    Total assets		115.460	115.373	93.540</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.366	 38.366	40.257</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.923	  1.756	 4.420</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.282	  0.176	 2.815</p>
</text>
